SUMMARY:Tampa Fine Art Show by Hot Works
LOCATION:Cotanchobee Fort Brooke Park 601 Old Water St Tampa \, FL 33602 U
 nited States
DESCRIPTION:Tampa Fine Art Show February 27 28\, 2027 Saturday\, 10am-5pm 
 and Sunday\, 10am-4pm Cotanchobee Fort Brooke Park is a beautifully renova
 ted waterfront park in downtown Tampa\, located at 601 Water Street along 
 the scenic Garrison Channel Riverwalk\, directly across from Benchmark Int
 ernational Arena (formerly Amalie Arena) home of the Tampa Bay Lightning  
 and one mile from University of Tampa. The park offers a peaceful oasis fo
 r recreation and relaxation\, featuring convenient Friday move-in access\,
  modern restroom facilities\, artist amenities\, and ample nearby parking.
  \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov/node/192286
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/192286
END:VEVENT
